  title: LIght Intensity Dependance
  key: 5
  topic: 4
  boardContentText: The lighthouse light intensity depends on an external generator
  boardSprite: {fileID: 0}
  contentText: "Eight years. Eight years I've been here and I didn't notice a thing
    like this. When an external generator is added, the light intensity changes.
    \nEight years \u2013 and this escaped me. How could I not have noticed. I'm a
    blind man. I could overlook absolutely anything."
  paperSprite: {fileID: 0}
